From: BangerSoul <bangersoul@antigravity.local>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fs/notify: Increase default inotify and fanotify user limits

On Android and modern desktop/mobile distributions (Halium, LineageOS GSI,
PostmarketOS), default inotify and fanotify quotas (8192 watches, 128 instances)
are quickly exhausted by background daemons, system services, indexers, and IDEs.
This causes "ENOSPC: System limit for number of file watchers reached" errors.

Increase default inotify limits:
- inotify max_user_watches: 8192 -> 1048576
- inotify max_user_instances: 128 -> 1024
- inotify max_queued_events: 16384 -> 32768

Increase default fanotify limits:
- fanotify default max_events: 16384 -> 32768
- fanotify default max_marks: 8192 -> 65536
- fanotify default max_listeners: 128 -> 1024

Signed-off-by: BangerSoul <bangersoul@antigravity.local>
---
 fs/notify/inotify/inotify_user.c   | 6 +++---
 fs/notify/fanotify/fanotify_user.c | 6 +++---
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/fs/notify/inotify/inotify_user.c b/fs/notify/inotify/inotify_user.c
index 8e30b62..c839d10 100644
--- a/fs/notify/inotify/inotify_user.c
+++ b/fs/notify/inotify/inotify_user.c
@@ -38,9 +38,9 @@
 #include <asm/ioctls.h>
 
 /* these are configurable via /proc/sys/fs/inotify/ */
-#define INOTIFY_SYSCTL_MAX_QUEUED_EVENTS	16384
-#define INOTIFY_SYSCTL_MAX_USER_INSTANCES	128
-#define INOTIFY_SYSCTL_MAX_USER_WATCHES	8192
+#define INOTIFY_SYSCTL_MAX_QUEUED_EVENTS	32768
+#define INOTIFY_SYSCTL_MAX_USER_INSTANCES	1024
+#define INOTIFY_SYSCTL_MAX_USER_WATCHES	1048576
 
 static struct kmem_cache *inotify_inode_mark_cachep __read_mostly;
 
diff --git a/fs/notify/fanotify/fanotify_user.c b/fs/notify/fanotify/fanotify_user.c
index a1f1854..f729b28 100644
--- a/fs/notify/fanotify/fanotify_user.c
+++ b/fs/notify/fanotify/fanotify_user.c
@@ -29,9 +29,9 @@
 
 #include "fanotify.h"
 
-#define FANOTIFY_DEFAULT_MAX_EVENTS	16384
-#define FANOTIFY_DEFAULT_MAX_MARKS	8192
-#define FANOTIFY_DEFAULT_MAX_LISTENERS	128
+#define FANOTIFY_DEFAULT_MAX_EVENTS	32768
+#define FANOTIFY_DEFAULT_MAX_MARKS	65536
+#define FANOTIFY_DEFAULT_MAX_LISTENERS	1024
 
 /*
  * Notification groups are limited to FANOTIFY_DEFAULT_MAX_LISTENERS groups
-- 
